[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0386","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0386.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0682","title":"Apache Tomcat Servlet Mapping 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Apache Tomcat 4.0.3 的 /servlet/ 映射存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。当 Servlet 抛出异常时，Tomcat 未对 URL 中的脚本代码进行过滤，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送包含恶意脚本的特制 URL，诱使其他用户访问，从而在用户浏览器中执行任意脚本代码，窃取会话 Cookie 或执行其他恶意操作。该漏洞影响 Apache Tomcat 4.0.3 版本，无需认证即可利用，危害较大。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0682"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-23T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:56Z","remediation":"升级 Apache Tomcat 至 4.0.6 或 4.1.13 及以上版本（该漏洞在此版本中修复）。由于 Tomcat 4.x 已停止维护，建议迁移至 Tomcat 9.0.x 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可删除或禁用 invoker servlet（在 web.xml 中注释掉 org.apache.catalina.servlets.InvokerServlet 的映射），并移除示例应用（删除 webapps 目录下的 examples 文件夹）以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q3/0014.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102631703811297&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/4973","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5193","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/9520","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/29dc6c2b625789e70a9c4756b5a327e6547273ff8bde7e0327af48c5%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/c62b0e3a7bf23342352a5810c640a94b6db69957c5c19db507004d74%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rb71997f506c6cc8b530dd845c084995a9878098846c7b4eacfae8db3%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21604","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-0682.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0682.json","https://github.com/p0dalirius/ApacheTomcatScanner/blob/af5077ce3aeae4c7df3be909998bb54e3812c742/apachetomcatscanner/data/vulnerabilities/2002/CVE-2002-0682.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0682","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0682.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0682.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0682.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0913c49bc4f4fd607e8625f162967246063e1d20/2002/CVE-2002-0682.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0682.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0682.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0386.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0385","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0385.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0681","title":"GoAhead Web Server 2.1.x 错误页面跨站脚本漏洞","description":"GoAhead Web Server 2.1.x 版本存在跨站脚本漏洞。当攻击者在 URL 中注入恶意脚本代码并请求不存在的路径时，服务器生成的\"404 Not Found\"错误页面未对脚本内容进行正确转义或引号包裹，导致脚本在用户浏览器中执行。远程攻击者可利用此漏洞窃取其他 Web 用户的 Cookie、会话令牌或执行恶意操作，影响 GoAhead Web Server 2.1 全系列版本。攻击无需认证，仅需诱使用户访问特制链接即可触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0681"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-23T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:56Z","remediation":"立即升级至 GoAhead 2.2 安全更新版本（Embedthis 已发布，100% 兼容 2.1.8 API，修复了所有已知安全问题）。如无法升级，可修改 404 错误处理页面源码，对 URL 中的用户输入进行 HTML 实体编码转义（如将 `<` 替换为 `&lt;`、`>` 替换为 `&gt;`），防止脚本注入。对于新设备项目，建议迁移至 Embedthis 当前维护的 Ioto 嵌入式 Web 服务器以获得持续安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q3/0013.html","http://freecode.com/projects/embedthis-goahead-webserver/releases/343539","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102631742711795&w=2","http://osvdb.org/81099","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9518.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5198","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21608","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-0681.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0681.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0681","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0681.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0681.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0913c49bc4f4fd607e8625f162967246063e1d20/2002/CVE-2002-0681.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0681.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0681.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-06xx/CVE-2002-0681.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0681.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0385.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0385.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0385.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0384","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0384.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0680","title":"GoAhead WebServer URL编码斜杠目录遍历漏洞","description":"GoAhead Web Server 2.1.x 存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送包含 URL 编码反斜杠（%5C）的 `../` 序列的 HTTP 请求，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞源于服务器对 URL 编码的路径分隔符处理不当，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可能导致敏感信息泄露。需要注意的是，此 CVE 编号已被报告为 CVE-2001-0228 的重复项。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0680"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-23T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:55Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 GoAhead WebServer 至 2.2 及以上版本，该版本已修复目录遍历漏洞。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器配置中禁用 URL 中的反斜杠编码（%5C）解析，或通过反向代理/WAF 规则过滤包含 `..%5C` 或 `%5C..` 模式的请求路径。同时限制 Web 服务进程对敏感系统目录（如 /etc、/winnt）的读取权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q3/0013.html","http://freecode.com/projects/embedthis-goahead-webserver/releases/343539","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102631742711795&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102709382714597&w=2","http://osvdb.org/81099","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21607","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-0680.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2002/CVE-2002-0680.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0680.json","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-0680.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0680","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0680.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/3a751de84316f1f1910c7d0a918a0e2c4180a6d3/CVEs/2002/CVE-2002-0680.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0680.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0680.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-0680.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0384.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0360","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0360.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0624","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 2000 密码加密程序缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 2000（包括 MSDE 2000）的密码加密函数中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于程序在处理 SQL Server 身份验证时的密码加密过程缺乏充分的边界检查，远程未经身份验证的攻击者可通过发送特制的认证请求触发该漏洞。攻击者可利用此缺陷获取数据库控制权并执行任意代码，导致系统被完全接管。该漏洞影响所有使用 SQL Server 身份验证的 SQL Server 2000 及相关桌面引擎版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0624"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-23T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:47Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Microsoft SQL Server 2000 升级至更高版本或安装微软发布的相应安全补丁。如无法立即升级，请在防火墙上限制 1433 端口的访问权限，或将身份验证模式从“SQL Server 身份验证”更改为“仅 Windows 身份验证”以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-22.html","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2002/ms02-034","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A291","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21549","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a4cc8a55779a13aab23d5f0d0cd6e52496b071eb/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0624.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/22bf0a843f1870af65d30413f104d6fa91f5e1f4/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0624.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0624","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0624.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0624.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/94c592af9de75672e76fb3f273444726c40342a0/2002/CVE-2002-0624.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0624.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-06xx/CVE-2002-0624.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0624.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0624.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0360.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0229","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0229.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0688","title":"Zope Zope 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Zope 2.4.0 至 2.5.1 版本中的 ZCatalog 插件索引支持功能存在访问控制绕过漏洞。该漏洞源于 ZCatalog 插件索引支持功能未正确验证访问权限，导致未经身份认证的匿名用户和不可信代码可绕过访问限制，直接调用目录索引的任意方法。攻击者无需认证即可通过网络远程利用该漏洞，攻击复杂度低，可造成部分机密性、完整性和可用性影响（CVSS 7.5，高危）。影响范围涵盖 Zope 2.4.0 至 2.5.1 版本，攻击者可通过调用任意索引方法实施信息泄露、数据篡改或服务拒绝攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0688"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-07-23T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:56Z","remediation":"立即升级 Zope 到 2.13.x 或 4.x 系列，至少版本 2.13.29，以修复 ZCatalog 索引支持漏洞。紧急情况下可将 web_python 脚本中 ZCatalog 访问权限修改为仅限内部用户，并通过 web.xml 配置中启用安全管理器。访问控制列表（ACL）应严格限制未认证用户的 ZCatalog 方法访问，如使用这样的配置：<acquired xmlns=\"...\" id=\"zpublisher.publish_rates.default\"><allow>Python scripts</allow><forbid>Catalog operations</forbid></acquired>","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2004/dsa-490","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9610.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-060.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5812","http://www.zope.org/Products/Zope/Hotfix_2002-06-14/security_alert","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fc5c3e6f60accc24b7eac4fd31472f0e5fd97f24/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0688.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/GHSA/data/2002/CVE-2002-0688.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0688.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0688","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/zope/CVE-2002-0688.yml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0688.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0688.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2002/CVE-2002-0688.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7f8cb0f5372a51b89f819e1c3a9d694706e18788/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0688.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-06xx/CVE-2002-0688.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0229.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0227","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0227.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0687","title":"Zope 远程服务拒绝漏洞","description":"Zope 2.0 至 2.5.1 b1 版本的\"通过 Web 代码\"功能存在访问控制缺陷，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送特定 HTTP 头部向 Zope 服务器发送关闭指令，导致服务拒绝。该漏洞源于 Zope 未对通过 Web 提交的管理代码执行权限进行充分验证，攻击者无需认证即可通过发送特定 Header 触发服务器关闭，导致服务完全不可用。影响 Zope 2.0 至 2.5.1 beta 1 所有版本，CVSS 5.0 分（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），属可用性影响类漏洞。攻击者只需向目标发送包含特定关闭指令的 HTTP 请求即可触发，无需认证且无需用户交互。官方已在后续版本修复该权限校验缺陷。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0687"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-07-23T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:56Z","remediation":"建议升级 Zope 到 2.5.1 正式版或更高版本（如 2.6.0 及以上），官方已在正式版中修复 \"through the web code\" 关闭服务器漏洞。若暂时无法升级，可在 Web 服务器层面（如 Apache/nginx）配置规则拦截包含恶意头部的请求，或在防火墙层面限制非受信 IP 访问 Zope 管理端口（默认 8080/9673）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9621.php","http://www.osvdb.org/5166","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-060.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5813","http://www.zope.org/Products/Zope/Hotfix_2002-04-15/security_alert","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fc5c3e6f60accc24b7eac4fd31472f0e5fd97f24/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0687.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0687.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/GHSA/data/2002/CVE-2002-0687.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0687","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/zope/CVE-2002-0687.yml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0687.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0687.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2002/CVE-2002-0687.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-06xx/CVE-2002-0687.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7f8cb0f5372a51b89f819e1c3a9d694706e18788/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0687.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0227.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0381","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0381.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0676","title":"Apple Mac OS X SoftwareUpdate 任意软件包安装漏洞","description":"Apple Mac OS X 10.1.x 系统的 SoftwareUpdate 组件在下载软件更新时未对更新服务器进行身份认证，远程攻击者可通过 DNS 欺骗或缓存投毒等技术伪装成 Apple 更新服务器，向目标系统分发特制的木马更新包，从而在目标系统上以系统权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Mac OS X 10.1.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0676"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:55Z","remediation":"升级至 Mac OS X 10.2 (Jaguar) 或更高版本，该版本中 SoftwareUpdate 已引入数字签名验证机制，可防止篡改更新包。如无法升级，可在网络层面配置 DNSSEC 防止 DNS 缓存投毒，并在防火墙上限制出站连接仅允许访问 Apple 官方更新服务器 (swscan.apple.com)。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cunap.com/~hardingr/projects/osx/exploit.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9502.php","http://www.osvdb.org/5137","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5176","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21596","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0676.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0676","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0676.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0676.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0676.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b258f1790af19a85ccc98f5e771360cd7a4cb4d7/2002/CVE-2002-0676.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0676.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-06xx/CVE-2002-0676.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0676.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0676.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0381.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0381.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0381.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0378","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0378.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0665","title":"Macromedia JRun 管理后台身份认证绕过漏洞","description":"Macromedia JRun 管理服务器存在身份认证绕过漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过在登录表单 URL 末尾添加额外斜杠（/）绕过认证机制，直接访问管理控制台。该漏洞影响 JRun 3 和 4 版本，攻击复杂度低，无需特殊权限即可利用。成功利用后攻击者可完全控制服务器，执行任意管理操作，包括部署恶意应用、读取敏感数据等，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0665"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:54Z","remediation":"升级 Macromedia JRun 至 4.0 最新更新版本（Updater 5 及以上），该版本修复了 URL 路径中多余斜杠导致认证绕过的缺陷。如使用 JRun 3，应先升级至 JRun 4 再安装更新。临时缓解措施：在反向代理或防火墙层面限制对 JRun Administration Server（默认端口 8000）的访问，仅允许可信管理 IP 连接。由于 JRun 已停止维护，建议迁移至 Adobe ColdFusion 或 Tomcat 等受支持的应用服务器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q2/0133.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102529402127195&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9450.php","http://www.macromedia.com/v1/handlers/index.cfm?ID=23164","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5118","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21582","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0665.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0665.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0665","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0665.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0665.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2720049fa2ff0728cf5af8a5d5207201a53780f6/2002/CVE-2002-0665.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0665.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-06xx/CVE-2002-0665.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0665.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/67f0cd4c1596148edc70751caa01ad7684d5c638/content/CVE-2002-0665.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0378.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0378.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0378.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0361","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0361.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0637","title":"Trend Micro InterScan VirusWall 邮件头扫描绕过漏洞","description":"Trend Micro InterScan VirusWall 3.52 build 1462 存在邮件头解析绕过漏洞（Space Gap）。远程攻击者可通过发送包含违反 RFC 规范的畸形邮件头（如 Content-Type 或 Content-Transfer-Encoding 后缺少或多余空格、边界声明前缺少空格、边界值后包含多余空格）的电子邮件，绕过病毒扫描引擎的检测。Outlook Express 在处理此类畸形邮件头时与 InterScan VirusWall 的解析逻辑不一致，导致恶意附件可被正常投递至用户。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，影响机密性、完整性和可用性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0637"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:50Z","remediation":"立即升级 Trend Micro InterScan VirusWall 至 3.52 build 1462 之后的版本，该版本已修复邮件头空格绕过扫描的问题。如无法升级，可在邮件网关层面配置内容过滤规则，拦截 Content-Type 或 Content-Transfer-Encoding 等头字段中异常空格的邮件，并启用 RFC 合规性检查。由于该产品已停止支持，建议迁移至 Trend Micro 当前支持的邮件安全产品（如 Deep Security 或 ScanMail Suite）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9464.php","http://www.securiteam.com/securitynews/5KP000A7QE.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21625","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-0637.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0637.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0637.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0637","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/3a751de84316f1f1910c7d0a918a0e2c4180a6d3/CVEs/2002/CVE-2002-0637.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0637.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0637.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0637.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-0637.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/963f7056505b7264e8baa3ce879232850f792056/2002/CVE-2002-0637.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0361.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0217","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0217.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0653","title":"Apache mod_ssl Off-by-One 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Apache mod_ssl 模块 2.8.9 及更早版本中存在 off-by-one 缓冲区溢出漏洞，位于 ssl_compat_directive 函数中，该函数由 rewrite_command 钩子调用。本地攻击者可通过向 .htaccess 文件写入超长条目触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，从而以 Apache 服务器用户身份执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Apache mod_ssl 2.8.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。建议升级至 mod_ssl 2.8.10 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0653"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:52Z","remediation":"将 mod_ssl 升级至 2.8.10 或更高版本（Apache httpd 2.0 用户应升级至 2.0.37 及以上版本）。各发行版用户请安装对应安全更新：Red Hat 安装 RHSA-2002:134/135/136 更新，Debian 安装 DSA-135 更新，Mandrake 安装 MDKSA-2002:048 更新。如无法立即升级，可在 httpd.conf 中禁用 AllowOverride 指令（设置为 None），阻止普通用户在 .htaccess 中触发该漏洞，并确保 .htaccess 文件仅由可信管理员管理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-06/0350.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/hp/2002-q3/0018.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000504","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102513970919836&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102563469326072&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=vuln-dev&m=102477330617604&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-164.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-135","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9415.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-048.php","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_028_mod_ssl.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-134.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-135.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-136.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-146.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-106.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5084","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21575","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-0653.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0653.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0653.json","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-0653.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0653","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0653.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0653.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-0653.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bb000df9f27fa146ab353b5455f4a8607b3ce719/2002/CVE-2002-0653.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0653.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0217.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0217.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0217.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0371","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0371.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0652","title":"SGI IRIX rpc.xfsmd 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 6.5 至 6.5.16 版本中的 xfsmd 服务存在远程命令执行漏洞。该服务在调用 popen() 函数（如 export_fs()）时未正确过滤 shell 元字符，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络发送特制请求，利用 shell 元字符注入执行任意系统命令，完全控制目标主机。该漏洞影响 IRIX 6.x 全系列版本，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0652"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:52Z","remediation":"立即升级 SGI IRIX 至 6.5.17 或更高版本（SGI 已发布安全补丁修复 rpc.xfsmd 中 popen() 调用未过滤 shell 元字符的问题）。如无法升级，立即停止 xfsmd 服务（/etc/init.d/xfsmd stop）并从 inetd 配置中移除该服务条目，同时在防火墙层面阻断对 RPC 端口 177 的未授权访问。由于 IRIX 已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的操作系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102459162909825&w=2","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21571","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-0652.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0652.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0652.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-0652.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0652","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0652.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0652.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0652.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-0652.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e8b136ad0f9c6a3aaf75bfb273a0e3f34c40c3fb/2002/CVE-2002-0652.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0371.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0341","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0341.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0572","title":"FreeBSD 等BSD系统 标准I/O文件描述符关闭权限提升漏洞","description":"BSD类操作系统（包括FreeBSD 4.5及更早版本、Apple Mac OS X 10.x、OpenBSD 2.x、Solaris 2.5/2.6/7.0/8等）的exec C库函数存在标准I/O文件描述符关闭漏洞。本地未授权用户可先关闭标准输入（fd 0）、标准输出（fd 1）或标准错误（fd 2）的文件描述符，随后当setuid进程执行I/O操作时，系统会复用这些已关闭的描述符号去打开受限文件（如/etc/passwd），导致setuid进程在不知情的情况下对受保护文件进行读写，从而绕过权限限制获取敏感信息或提权。该漏洞仅需本地登录权限即可利用，无需网络访问，影响范围覆盖多个主流BSD类操作系统，CVSS评分为7.2，危害等级为高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0572"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:41Z","remediation":"升级 FreeBSD 到 4.4-RELEASE-p17 或更高版本、4.5-RELEASE-p10 或更高版本，或应用到 4.6-STABLE，然后重新编译内核以应用安全补丁。具体步骤是：下载对应的 SA-02:23 补丁，从 /usr/src 目录运行 patch 命令，重新配置并编译内核，最后重启系统以激活修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q2/0033.html","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/268970","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/269102","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/m-072.shtml","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8920.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/809347","http://www.osvdb.org/6095","http://www.securityfocus.co