 4.1x\n- 攻击条件: remote, no authentication\n\nThe description should not have the `tags.` prefix or embedded `<value>` markers - just clean text.\n\nOutput only the description value, no extra content besides maybe brief analysis. The instructions say final answer must be within `<value>...","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0554"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:39Z","remediation":"` wrapper. I need to output only the field value between <value> tags.\n\nThe current remediation content is decent but has the \"tags.\" prefix problem. I need to produce a clean version, ≥20 characters Chinese, with specific actionable steps.\n\nLet me write a clean remediation without the \"tags.\" prefix and without nested <value> tags.<value>该产品为 2002 年发布的 IBM Informix Web DataBlade 4.12，早已停止技术支持，厂商补丁已不适用，应优先采取升级迁移与访问控制相结合的缓解措施。具体操作：1) 尽快将 Informix Web DataBlade 迁移升级至受支持的数据库版本或改用受支持的 Web 数据访问中间件（如 IBM 新一代 Web 服务方案），替换存在漏洞的 webdriver 组件；2) 在 Web 服务器层（Apache/IIS）对 webdriver 所在 URL 路径配置访问控制列表（ACL），仅允许受信任内网来源 IP 访问，并启用基础身份认证限制非法访问；3) 对所有传入 webdriver 的 HTTP 请求参数执行严格输入校验与参数化查询处理，过滤单引号等 SQL 注入特殊字符；4) 为 Web DataBlade 连接数据库使用最小权限账号，严禁以 informix 等高权限用户运行该组件，降低注入攻击成功后的数据泄露影响范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-04/0135.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8826.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4496","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21374","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e409cc3aa72de0994d4d1b2baf38bcac39a42cdc/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0554.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0554.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0554","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0554.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0554.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c0d14064d79c9a0ab84002492c5a6bf474f81cd3/2002/CVE-2002-0554.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/93d966ccbf562a1a0fe2dcab2089012ce2b11591/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-05xx/CVE-2002-0554.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0554.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0554.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0554.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0340.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0339","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0339.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0553","title":"Turnkey Solutions SunShop 购物车系统跨站脚本漏洞","description":"SunShop 购物车系统（SunShop Shopping Cart）1.5 至 2.5 版本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。其新客户注册功能未能对用户名、地址等注册表单字段进行充分的输入验证与输出编码，属于存储型 XSS（User-Embedded Scripting）。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可在注册字段中注入恶意脚本，当管理员在后台查看注册客户信息时脚本于管理员浏览器中执行，攻击者可借此窃取管理员会话 Cookie 并获取管理权限，进而完全控制该购物车系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0553"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:39Z","remediation":"tags.<value>建议立即将 SunShop 购物车系统升级至 2.5 之后的修复版本（如 3.0 及以上版本），以修复新客户注册功能中缺少输入过滤的缺陷；如暂时无法升级，应在注册表单的姓名、地址、邮箱等字段对用户输入进行严格校验，过滤并去除 `<script>` 等危险 HTML 标签，并对输出进行 HTML 实体编码；同时关闭后台对注册字段 HTML 内容的解析支持，限制管理员的默认权限，防止存储型 XSS 窃取会话导致权限提升。此外，可在 Web 层部署应用防火墙对请求负载中的脚本特征进行拦截作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-04/0154.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8840.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4506","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21377","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e409cc3aa72de0994d4d1b2baf38bcac39a42cdc/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0553.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0553","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0553.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0553.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0553.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/47bb69b00d30a4ddac9a224d4b4672d3efbf78ef/2002/CVE-2002-0553.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0553.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/93d966ccbf562a1a0fe2dcab2089012ce2b11591/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-05xx/CVE-2002-0553.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0553.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0553.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0339.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0339.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0339.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0336","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0336.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0552","title":"Melange Chat System 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Melange Chat System 2.0.2 Beta 2 存在多处缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程或本地攻击者可通过向聊天服务器发送超长数据触发该漏洞，导致服务器崩溃（拒绝服务）并可能进一步执行任意代码。漏洞成因在于程序对用户输入缺乏充分的边界检查，具体攻击路径包括：通过 `/yell` 命令传入超长参数、在 `/etc/melange.conf` 配置文件中写入超长行内容、以及通过超长文件名等方式均可触发溢出。该漏洞的利用条件简单，攻击者无需进行身份认证，攻击复杂度低，影响所有运行受影响版本 Melange Chat Server 的实例。由于该软件目前已停止官方支持，受影响系统无法获得官方补丁，建议管理员迁移至替代的聊天服务器软件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0552"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:39Z","remediation":"该漏洞存在于 Melange Chat System 2.02 的 /yell 命令及配置文件中，由于 Christian Walter 已停止对该软件的维护且不再提供补丁，建议立即停用 Melange Chat System，迁移至受持续维护的替代聊天服务器软件（如 IRCd 或现代即时通讯平台）。如短期内无法完成迁移，应在防火墙或访问控制设备上禁止外部网络访问 Melange Chat 服务端口，并对 melange.conf 配置文件中的长行内容实施输入校验与长度限制，以降低缓冲区溢出被利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-04/0157.html","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/267932","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8842.php","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8845.php","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8846.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4508","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4509","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4510","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21379","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/04cbba20eadf072d0c2a69a2764987d5116b9b8d/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0552.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0552","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a4bac3f294639f471e4ce83e9756b93968e8a651/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0552.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0552.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0552.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/60372a8a278934a3b69e959c9b5f05f82cdadbb6/2002/CVE-2002-0552.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/12d6976fbc16ebd7d2a9bfdaca2b71011ba41d33/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0552.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/89df9ecdfb1d185f16236a951ba57b31903da53e/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-05xx/CVE-2002-0552.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-055